meta-causality-labs
===================

Yocto layers for Causality Labs software.

Layers
------

meta-causality-apps
    Hardware-independent application recipes.

meta-causality-imx
    Board support for NXP i.MX boards: kernel configuration and
    board-specific settings.

Usage
-----

Add the layers to conf/bblayers.conf:

    BBLAYERS += "${BSPDIR}/sources/meta-causality-labs/meta-causality-apps"
    BBLAYERS += "${BSPDIR}/sources/meta-causality-labs/meta-causality-imx"

Add the packages you need to IMAGE_INSTALL in conf/local.conf, then
build your image.

Guidelines
----------

Keep anything hardware-specific out of meta-causality-apps. It belongs
in a board support layer such as meta-causality-imx or a new bsp layer.
